      "reasoning": "The passage says autovacuum running to prevent transaction ID wraparound is not automatically interrupted by conflicting locks, unlike normal autovacuum.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "However, if the autovacuum is running to prevent transaction ID wraparound (i.e., the autovacuum query name in the pg_stat_activity view ends with (to prevent wraparound)), the autovacuum is not automatically interrupted."
